---
---

<section class="border-b border-[var(--color-ink-200)] bg-[var(--color-paper)]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-32 pb-20 sm:pt-40 sm:pb-24">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[3fr_2fr] lg:items-start">
      <div class="max-w-[var(--prose-max)]">
        <h2 data-reveal class="font-heading text-[length:var(--text-h2)] font-semibold text-ink-950">
          Coordinators shouldn't be a human plan validator.
        </h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5 text-[length:var(--text-lead)] leading-relaxed text-[color:var(--color-text)]">
          <p>
            A 300-student cohort, three revision rounds a term — that's the shape of the problem. Every plan starts as a half-built PDF or spreadsheet, and every EC shortfall, missing prerequisite, or track violation only surfaces once a student emails to ask what counts.
          </p>
          <p>
            Coordinators answer the same handful of questions hundreds of times a term, then catch the real errors too late to matter — after registration has closed, after the swap window is gone.
          </p>
          <p>
            StudyPlanner moves the check to the moment the plan is built, not the moment it lands in an inbox.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-reveal class="border border-[var(--color-ink-200)] bg-[var(--color-paper-shade)] p-6 font-mono text-sm">
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Before</p>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-flag-600)]">
          <span class="line-through decoration-2">AE4-ADS + AE4-SD (32 EC, prereq unmet)</span>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">→ flagged after submission, three weeks late</p>
        <div class="my-5 h-px bg-[var(--color-ink-200)]"></div>
        <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">After</p>
        <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[var(--color-valid-600)]">
          AE4-ADS + AE4-SP (30 EC, prereqs met)
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path class="check-draw" d="M3 8.5 6.5 12 13 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
          </svg>
        </p>
        <p class="mt-1 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">→ validated the moment it's built</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
